  "title": "pH and [H⁺] · pOH · pKw · Equations 8.6–8.8",
  "headingUrdu": "pH اور [H⁺] · pOH · pKw · مساوات 8.6–8.8",
  "headingPashto": "pH او [H⁺] · pOH · pKw · معادلې 8.6–8.8",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "source": {
    "pdfPage": 252,
